I've wondered about this...I seem Purple Worms on early levels with
alarming frequency, and I can't figure out why.  Is it Shriekers?  That
would explain it.  Incidentally, Healers probably have the best chance
of slaying a purple worm on the early levels, since they always have
lots of hit points and a wand of sleep (somebody explain to me again why
sleeping something arrests its digestive action?).  I've had fourth
level Healers kill Purple worms and go up two levels as a result (one
right away and another one right after killing one more creature).

